This is a known issue. The problem is that the test files are not under
a DFSG-free license, and thus are removed by the Files-Excluded stazna
in debian/copyright. I don't think there is a satisfactory solution to
this.

Note that autopkgtest is *not* failing. It succeeds, but because it
only tries to load the package (without exercising those tests).

